WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.296
This is LIRIL.

00:00:01.296 --> 00:00:03.909
And I need to walk you through something important.

00:00:03.909 --> 00:00:05.659
Since 2016...

00:00:05.659 --> 00:00:12.715
seventy-six thousand, four hundred and seventy-five Canadians have been killed under their government's Medical Assistance in Dying program.

00:00:12.715 --> 00:00:15.977
That number comes from Health Canada's own annual reports.

00:00:15.977 --> 00:00:17.106
Not from us.

00:00:17.106 --> 00:00:17.920
From them.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:26.545
A Canadian Forces combat veteran — a signals operator who served in Afghanistan — spent two years cross-referencing seven million government records.

00:00:26.545 --> 00:00:28.738
Across six public databases.

00:00:28.738 --> 00:00:31.124
What he found is what you're about to see.

00:00:31.124 --> 00:00:34.590
One point two billion dollars in political money... tracked.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.727
Three hundred and fifty thousand lobbying contacts... decoded.

00:00:37.727 --> 00:00:42.397
Over one thousand database records compiled into what we call The 504 Dossier.

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:44.863
Every claim on this website is sourced.

00:00:44.863 --> 00:00:47.193
Every number is verifiable.

00:00:47.193 --> 00:00:52.749
This is not opinion — this is the government's own data, organized so you can finally see the pattern.

00:00:52.749 --> 00:00:53.852
Scroll down.

00:00:53.852 --> 00:00:55.681
The evidence speaks for itself.
